  "user_id": 18605,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "### Behind the scenes\nHow does AI make an image from your words?\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8b6420bcb71cdfde2997b6575a7034c8-behind the scene.gif",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-e349bed8-89d6-4efc-8a0e-29b8a1e5afb1",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "### Learning from examples\n\nAI has studied thousands of pictures and their captions.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/99df39da5a4588f82a70c0fde6edfcb1-scan images.png",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-93102ee9-aa96-4429-aafb-52f8fe7fd787",
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "### Spotting patterns\n\nIt learned which image parts match certain words.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4ba753cee8d6a629492417e58e281b54-panel patterns.png",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-35731f8b-92f2-4309-954a-d8481cc58b14",
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "### Making guesses\n\nWhen you give it words, it predicts what to include.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info-0ae6fab6-0f3d-4751-bd68-31f5bc186f74"
      },
      {
        "text": "### Creating something new\n\nIt builds a new image similar to what it’s seen.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-07287924-c7c1-45c4-86e6-1dc2621827a0",
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "### It’s math! Not magic\n\nAI doesn’t understand; it just makes smart guesses.\n\nYou decide whether to keep it or try again!",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info_2-571b0646-acfe-4ce0-804b-d73443dba600",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "### You’re the judge\n\nIf it’s wrong or weird, you decide to keep it or try again!",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_6_dancer_info_7-ac509d01-b8ae-418e-a596-12d0f41a3403"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_7"
  },
